  "body": "Add Copper (`C11000 ETP` / `C10100 OFHC`) to the workpiece material list for documents, stock, cutting tables, CLI, and MCP.\n\n### Changes\n- Append `WorkMaterial::Copper` (`word: \"copper\"`, `label: \"Copper (C11000)\"`, ISO 513 group `N`, `kc11: 950.0`, `mc: 0.25`) to `WorkMaterial`, `WorkMaterial::ALL`, `TABLE`, and `TURN_TABLE` in `crates/tools/src/cutting.rs` and `crates/tools/src/turning_data.rs`.\n- Add `copper` to CLI usage in `crates/tools/src/bin/camcraft-tools.rs`.\n- Add `copper` to `set_work_material` and `add_tool` schema descriptions in `crates/app/src/mcp/cutting_tools.rs` and `crates/app/src/mcp/tools.rs`, update `docs/agents/mcp-tools.md`, and update `.claude/skills/camcraft-mcp/SKILL.md`.\n- Record Kienzle and cutting-window choices and covered copper grades in `docs/decisions/3262-copper-workpiece-material.md`.\n- Add pinning tests in `crates/tools/src/cutting.rs`, `crates/tools/src/turning_data.rs`, `crates/app/tests/cutting_data.rs`, `crates/app/tests/cutting_unknown_row.rs`, and `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests/stock_material.rs`.\n\n### Readings and pinning tests\nAll checks ran on final head `1266caa46ab71240070ac424eba8bf865f0ccaf4` in software and automated tests. No physical mill cut copper for these values.\n- Pinning tests:\n  - `copper_preset_is_appended_non_router_and_keeps_existing_rows` (`tools::lib`: 177 passed, 0 failed)\n  - `table_is_indexed_in_all_order_and_windows_are_ordered` (`tools::lib`)\n  - `copper_suggestion_power_turning_and_untabulated_limits_hold` (`cutting_data`: 7 passed, 0 failed)\n  - `copper_round_trips_save_reopen_and_mcp_while_existing_materials_still_load` (`cutting_unknown_row`: 10 passed, 0 failed)\n  - `the_stock_page_states_the_stock_material_through_one_undo_step` (`ui::lib`: 1712 passed, 0 failed, 8 ignored)\n  - `the_committed_reference_matches_the_live_tool_table` (`mcp_doc_drift`: 9 passed, 0 failed)\n- `cargo xtask gate quick --base 12ea01a45`: 40/40 steps green (`tools`, `app` lib + 28 suites, `ui` lib 1712 + 8 UI suites).\n- Additional cutting suites: `tools::unknown_row` (6 passed), `tools::plasma_cut` (8 passed), `tools::waterjet` (6 passed), `app::tool_cutting_rows` (11 passed), `app::hole_feed_rating` (7 passed), `app::cut_recipe` (20 passed).\n- `cargo xtask gate light`: 6/6 steps green (`motion` light lib 7 passed, `adaptive_troch_island` 1 passed, `adaptive_troch_neck` 1 passed, `adaptive_troch_parallel` 1 passed, `app::pocket_pass_start` 1 passed).\n- `cargo clippy -j 3 -p camcraft-tools -p camcraft-app -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings`: clean (`-j 6` hit host memory allocation limit while another build ran; `-j 3` passed cleanly).\n- Heavy lanes: none required (`P6` enhancement; full heavy lanes run on the cut runner).\n\n### Not exercised\n- No physical mill cut copper using these cutting parameters (conservative starting windows inside published handbook ranges only).\n- UI pixel snapshot goldens (`#[ignore]`) stay on the cut runner.\n- `git merge-tree --write-tree upstream/main 1266caa46` merges cleanly with zero conflicts.\n\nProcess change: yes\nfork synced at v0.27.0\nChangelog: Added Copper (C11000) to workpiece materials, cutting data tables, and MCP schemas.\nEffort: high\nFixes #3262\n",
